# <configuration> <test> <seed>
# Directed tests run once; tests with random stimulus run with seeds 1-4; test_random_long
# (150000 lite_aclk cycles) with seeds 1-10 at the default parameters and 1-3 at min and mid.
# cntmax runs the tests that exercise the 16-bit sequencer and IRQ_STATUS wait counters.
# test_checker_fault is not listed: it must end in FAIL and is run once by hand.
